  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1787470421088743}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 218
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 怎么说这也是已经拥有了灵智的妖兽诶，我才学了几天法术，就这几手三脚猫功夫，能对付的了它么？
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114946187578883155}
